Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.63,0:00:15.34,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Conference known as
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.63,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the Reverie has concluded.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.63,0:00:20.72,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a meeting that\Noccurs every four years,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.31,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,where a council of 50\Nworld leaders gather,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.31,0:00:26.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,representing some of\Nthe 170 nations
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,affiliated under\Nthe World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.28,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,As it often does,\Nthe event ended with
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,a great sense of uncertainty.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.36,0:00:43.24,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The representatives went home\Nwithout much reassurance.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.24,0:00:48.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Then. One week later.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.79,0:00:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Goodness,\Nthat's always such a trek.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's good to be home.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heading up to the surface world\Nalways takes so much out of me.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.55,0:01:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, I wanted to thank you\Nfor escorting us back safely!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.55,0:01:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mister Luffy's Grandpa!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.47,0:01:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet that excursion must have\Nbeen pretty draining on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.60,0:01:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundin' tuckered\Nthere out, Neptune!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can say that again!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp, why don't you\Ntake a load off
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.63,0:01:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and get some\Nwell-deserved rest, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and get some well-deserved rest?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.61,0:01:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'll stay for\Na cup of tea or two,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.03,0:01:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but not much longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want to be lax\Nat a time like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.72,0:01:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Reverie always\Nseems to result in chaos.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.07,0:01:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Reverie always seems\Nto result in chaos.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:30.37,0:01:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, when you have
Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,50 heads of state\Nin the same room,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can't expect them\Nto get along.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each country is only thinking\Nabout their own problems.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.84,0:01:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The major powers will\Nstare each other down
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.30,0:01:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and let the smaller nations\Nsquabble over this and that.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.66,0:01:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you've got the\Nresources and technology,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.08,0:01:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're the shot caller.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.91,0:01:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say all countries\Nare equal,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.25,0:02:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but those words\Nnever hold any weight.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.25,0:02:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as there are wealth\Nand religious differences,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.35,0:02:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there will never be true\Nequality, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.14,0:02:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it's time to shake,\Nthey grin,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.97,0:02:16.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then stomp each other's\Nfeet under the table.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.52,0:02:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These rulers can\Nspeak for themselves,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.44,0:02:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but can they speak\Nfor all their citizens
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.56,0:02:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or the citizens of\Nother nations?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "round table"\Nis nothing but a myth.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.74,0:02:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite true.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As they say,\Nyou could cut the tension
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in that room with a knife.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The source of that\Nfriction is a history
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.33,0:02:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that runs deep indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.37,0:02:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we are no exception.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, the issues\Nof the past are not
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.37,0:02:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,swept away so easily,\Nor quietly.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.75,0:02:43.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The way I see it,\Nas long as no blood's spilled
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.84,0:02:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The way I see it,\Nas long as no blood's
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.01,0:02:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,spilled at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.38,0:02:47.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I'm willing\Nto call it peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.47,0:02:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I'm willing\Nto call it peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.26,0:02:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This year's Reverie\Nwas bad though.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.26,0:02:53.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This year's Reverie\Nwas bad though.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.31,0:02:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have\Nsaid something sooner,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have\Nsaid something sooner,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.48,0:02:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there was an\Nincident that happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there was an\Nincident that happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.94,0:02:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't told anyone yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.06,0:02:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't told anyone yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.90,0:03:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took place right after\Nthe Reverie was dismissed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.10,0:03:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took place right after\Nthe Reverie was dismissed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.49,0:03:03.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a report when I was\Nleaving on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.61,0:03:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a report when I was\Nleaving on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.82,0:03:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me preface this\Nby saying the Navy
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me preface this\Nby saying the Navy
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.95,0:03:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is using everything it's\Ngot to settle this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.99,0:03:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is using everything it's got\Nto settle this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.20,0:03:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't fear humans\Nor the surface either!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.24,0:03:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't fear humans,\Nor the surface either!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.45,0:03:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could've happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The report must have\Nbeen rather serious
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.91,0:03:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for you to act this way, Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.67,0:03:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It concerns\Nthe Alabasta Kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.96,0:03:30.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please say it isn't so.\NPrincess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.47,0:03:35.76,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Shortly after\Nthe Reverie was dismissed,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.76,0:03:38.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the reporters were abuzz\Nat the headquarters
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.35,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,of the World Economic Journal.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.35,0:03:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are all these\Nthings happening at once?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.40,0:03:46.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's one thing\Nafter another! Jeez!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.23,0:03:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need\Na catchy headline for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.00,0:03:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one is\Ngoing on the front page?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This is big for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothin' rakes in cash\Nlike an obituary!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.91,0:04:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the cover story, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patience!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The resolution they\Npassed is juicy, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.13,0:04:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there was an\Nattempted murder.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.88,0:04:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I have a plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, Boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.63,0:04:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the first time ever,\Nwe're running dual covers,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.76,0:04:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a story on front and back!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.59,0:04:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir! You've got a\Ntelegram from the Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? This a check?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.73,0:04:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Look at those zeros!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they want me to cover up
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.19,0:04:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,one of these hot stories,\Ndo they? Gah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see which one it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.20,0:04:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't passing on\Nthe biggest scoop of my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.16,0:04:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping this story!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.01,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can keep their damn money.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.22,0:04:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a big mistake.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.39,0:04:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're going to do as your told.\NIs that clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.35,0:04:52.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Cipher Pol?\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To make sure that\Nyou obey orders
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.69,0:04:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the World\NGovernment. Freeze!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with\N"Big News" Morgans,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.28,0:05:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if y'know what's good for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.29,0:05:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did this louse get in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know he's\Na Government official, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to boogie. Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.63,0:05:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're compromised!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.93,0:05:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I may be\Na money-hungry scrooge,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but above all,\NI'm a journalist first!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get people's hearts dancing\Nwith the stories I compose!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a DJ of the press!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I decide what news\Nis fit to print!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.66,0:05:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Morgans!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.87,0:05:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Wapol of\NDrum Kingdom is calling!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds like\Nhe has some leaked information!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.38,0:05:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.39,0:06:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A special report?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't cry. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.45,0:06:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.62,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Including the incident
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.62,0:06:33.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,that the Government failed\Nto keep under wraps,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the news report also\Nspread word of the decision
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.25,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the leaders reached\Nwhile at the Reverie.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.25,0:06:43.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The disturbing news leaves\Nmany in shock across the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.38,0:06:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible!\NThis news can't be true!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.15,0:06:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible!\NThis news can't be true!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't buy into this poppycock,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.39,0:06:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the WEJ's either making\Nthis up or taking bribes!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.85,0:06:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That bird is lying through\Nhis smug little beak!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.98,0:07:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just know it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.36,0:07:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not dead! There's no way!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.74,0:07:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to confirm the facts.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with\Ntheir entire team, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we verify any of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.17,0:07:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Please Sabo.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't die.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.59,0:07:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Whoa! Is she okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What was he doing in Mariejois?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's my brother, for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with Makino?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.23,0:07:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know,\Nshe closed the bar today.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.73,0:07:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's so much chaos\Nin the world right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could really use a drink.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.03,0:07:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.79,0:07:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We only just found out\Nthat he was still alive, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.92,0:08:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could this happen\Nto you? Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.33,0:08:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world\Nsure can be a funny place!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.68,0:08:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's never a boring day!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.13,0:08:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we're just getting\Nto the good part now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.18,0:08:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we're just getting\Nto the good part now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.24,0:08:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wakey, wakey!\NTime to pack your bags!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the Navy wants\Nto get involved,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.87,0:08:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just take it myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.67,0:08:42.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Jumping ahead to the present.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.45,0:08:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coby? It's me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.69,0:09:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a sec.\NI need to find a better spot.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's right!\NThe "Sea"!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.49,0:09:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "Fog."
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.55,0:09:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "Fog." Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.43,0:09:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're as diligent\Nas ever, I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're as\Ndiligent as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.79,0:09:18.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm only following\Nthe protocol is all, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.85,0:09:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm only following\Nthe protocol is all! You know!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.50,0:09:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! By the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! By the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.96,0:09:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent report\Nfor you. Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent report\Nfor you, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're serious?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the current state\Nof affairs out there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sadly.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.18,0:09:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're having trouble\Nkeeping up with it all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.06,0:09:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Even with every active\NMarine on our side.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For your situation,\Nit's going as planned,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.86,0:09:52.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so the military won't\Nbe getting involved.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not like we have\Nthe manpower, anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.74,0:09:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably for the best.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.24,0:09:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano and the World Government\Naren't allied, regardless.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.41,0:10:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, tell me what you know about\NBig Mom arriving at Onigashima.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gladly. The Navy's banking\Non Kaido and Big Mom's
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,long-standing grudge\Nto get explosive.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're hoping those two\Ntake each other out.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.21,0:10:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to report\Nthis next bit then.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt\Nwe can count on them
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.13,0:10:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,being at each other's\Nthroats anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.26,0:10:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It turns out they're teaming up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.67,0:10:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-Wh-What?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.43,0:10:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you joking with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.82,0:10:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for Straw Hat Luffy,\Nit's a stalemate.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's been no news\Nof his breakout.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should also mention,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.11,0:10:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while I was in the\Ncapital the other day,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.91,0:10:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I happened to spot\NCipher Pol 0.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why are they in Wano?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really hoping I'm\Nwrong about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it would imply that\Nthe Government's colluding
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.42,0:10:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with a pirate-ruled country\Nto conduct some nasty business.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're\Nin a state of shock.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.68,0:11:03.34,Main-207+,,0,302,0,,I was too when I found out.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.44,0:11:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, where are you now?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traveling.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to\Nthe Island of Women.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.62,0:11:28.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to\Ncapture Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is there an entire fleet\Ncrossing the Calm Belt?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.88,0:11:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that the Navy?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Margaret!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever they want\Nwith us, it can't be good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.59,0:11:46.51,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The news continued\Nto spread across the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Bout time! They shoulda\Ndone this a long time ago!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know! It was wrong to\Nwork with pirates anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.90,0:11:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let 'em all die!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,There were many\Nwho celebrated the report.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those dumb Government lapdogs
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are finally goin' away!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Empress!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.66,0:12:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Hawk-Eye!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Clown!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.20,0:12:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You good-for-nothing looters\Ncan just piss off!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.41,0:12:12.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Those who had suffered
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.50,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,at the hands of pirates\Nespecially welcomed the news.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.50,0:12:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? I'm no fan, but imagine\Nhow the war in Marineford
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.96,0:12:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would've gone without them!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The nobles voted on this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet the Navy acts right away.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely\Ncertain about this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.55,0:12:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that was one of the three\Ngreat powers of the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, for those aware of
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.56,0:12:33.81,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,their involvement in\Nthe War of the Best,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.81,0:12:35.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and those concerned about how
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the distribution\Nof power will fall,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.77,0:12:41.32,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the discovery was\Na truly alarming situation.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The controversial\Narticle that covered
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.20,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the events of\Nthis year's Reverie
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.20,0:12:50.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,evoked many different emotions\Nfrom all ears who heard it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.49,0:12:52.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,But for better or for worse,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.33,0:12:54.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the abolition of the\NSeven Warlords of the Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.83,0:12:57.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,was absolute.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.29,0:13:00.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Before their dissolution,\Nthe Warlords consisted of
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.22,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,many of the world's\Nstrongest pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.22,0:13:04.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Officially recognized by\Nthe World Government,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.38,0:13:06.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,their crimes were overlooked,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.05,0:13:08.10,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,in exchange for their\Nuse as deterrents
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,against other criminals.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.89,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,As one might expect\Nwhen dealing with
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.02,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,such volatile personalities,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.02,0:13:17.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the roster rotated\Nover the years.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.52,0:13:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Former members include...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.98,0:13:23.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Crocodile.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.65,0:13:24.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,After growing in power,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.99,0:13:29.08,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,he attempted a coup\Nin the Kingdom of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.08,0:13:32.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Luckily, Luffy was able to\Nstop him before he succeeded,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and he was expelled\Nfrom the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.75,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It didn't take long\Nto replace him.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.75,0:13:42.50,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The man promoted to fill\Nthe role was Marshal D. Teach.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.50,0:13:44.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, that didn't last long.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.88,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He announced his resignation
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.88,0:13:49.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,after stealing\NWhitebeard's power.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.60,0:13:52.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Then there was the\N"First Son of the Sea" Jinbe,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.26,0:13:55.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,whose sense of justice\Nput him at odds with the Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.52,0:13:59.19,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He declared his departure\Nduring the War of the Best.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Another former member\Nwas Gecko Moria.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.49,0:14:07.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This ghoulish figure, who had\Na run-in with the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.49,0:14:10.53,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,also took part in\Nthe War of the Best.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.57,0:14:14.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, after the skirmish,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,he was deemed\Nill-suited for the role,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.79,0:14:20.04,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Government sent out\Nmen to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.04,0:14:24.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Then there's the Heavenly Demon,\NDon Quixote Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He earned his notoriety\Nfor many reasons,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,including overthrowing\NDressrosa,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.97,0:14:30.89,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,trafficking artificial\NDevil Fruits,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.89,0:14:34.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,as well as being an influential\Nunderground broker.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.71,0:14:37.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, his position\Nin the system
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.68,0:14:41.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,was revoked after being defeated\Nby Luffy and his allies.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.86,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,One of which was Trafalgar Law,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.86,0:14:46.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,another Warlord of the Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, thanks to\Nhis involvement
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,in the liberation of Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.74,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,he too was stripped of his role.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.74,0:14:54.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,There is another\Ngroup of pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.49,0:14:57.54,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,even more fearsome\Nthan the Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.12,0:15:03.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,They are opposed by\Nthe Marines of the Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.79,0:15:06.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords\Nexist in the middle.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.80,0:15:09.55,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,These three great powers\Nhave seemingly
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.55,0:15:12.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,kept peace in the world\Nfor many years.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.22,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.22,0:15:15.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Two leaders emerged\Nwhose nations
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,had suffered because\Nof the Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,King Nefeltari Cobra\Nof Alabasta.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.94,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,And Riku Doldo the Third\Nof Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.94,0:15:27.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,They led a heartfelt\Nargument at the Reverie.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.61,0:15:30.15,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The abolition of the\NSeven Warlord system
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.15,0:15:31.53,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,was their solution.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.53,0:15:36.16,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The matter was put to\Na majority vote, and passed.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.95,0:15:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As of this day,\Nyou no longer have
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.00,0:15:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As of this day,\Nyou no longer have
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.70,0:15:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,any ties to the\NWorld Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,any ties to the\NWorld Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.75,0:15:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of your\Nprivileges and rights
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of your privileges\Nand rights as one of
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.54,0:15:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as one of the Seven Warlords\Nhave been immediately revoked!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.18,0:15:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Seven Warlords have\Nbeen immediately revoked!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.17,0:15:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.38,0:15:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Buggy? I know you're there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.51,0:15:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Buggy! I know you're there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.26,0:15:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're nothing but\Na pirate again!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.31,0:15:54.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're nothing but\Na pirate again!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.40,0:15:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is any of\Nthis crap fair, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.43,0:15:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is any of\Nthis crap fair, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, you declare me a Warlord,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.57,0:15:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you jerk me around\Nand take it away?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you jerk me around\Nand take it away?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.77,0:16:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now you wanna arrest me
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now you wanna\Narrest me because
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.19,0:16:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because you morons were\Ndumb enough to be scammed
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you morons were\Ndumb enough to be
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.16,0:16:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,scammed by Crocodile\Nand Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by Crocodile and Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.57,0:16:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.40,0:16:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you imbeciles\Neven hear yourselves?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.62,0:16:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you imbeciles\Neven hear yourselves?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.32,0:16:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have\Nthe whole coast surrounded!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.37,0:16:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have\Nthe whole coast surrounded!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got a plan, Boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.37,0:16:21.33,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,These buzzkills are\Nscrewing up my life plans!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.87,0:16:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought the Navy was supposed\Nto be on our side though!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.00,0:16:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey? Mommy?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.42,0:16:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender yourself\Nat once, "Hawk-Eye" Mihawk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.31,0:16:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess!\NWe have a situation!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's been a report\Nyour title as
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a Warlord of the Sea\Nhas been ripped away!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.19,0:16:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny Nyon! Navy ships\Nare approaching fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny Nyon! Navy ships\Nare approaching fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.73,0:16:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Already?\NThis surely means trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.78,0:16:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Already?\NThis surely means trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.54,0:17:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have the advantage.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've forgotten.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in it deep,\NChairman Buggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.92,0:17:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we try to run?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we try to run?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.13,0:17:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.49,0:17:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.47,0:17:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are gonna give them\Nthe fight of their lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.83,0:17:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are gonna give them\Nthe fight of their lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.77,0:17:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to get flashy!\NYou cowards!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.85,0:17:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our chairman for ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.98,0:17:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.03,0:17:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Opposing us will be\Nthe last mistake you ever make!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Opposing us will be\Nthe last mistake you ever make!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.58,0:17:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.65,0:17:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weevil! Approval to\Ngive them hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.31,0:17:42.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weevil! Approval to\Ngive them hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.96,0:17:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Mommy?\NI'm gonna rip 'em apart then!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.98,0:17:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Mommy?\NI'm gonna rip 'em apart then!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.21,0:17:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the name of Whitebeard,\NI'll stomp all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the name of Whitebeard,\NI'll stomp all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.99,0:17:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel a shudder of excitement.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.17,0:17:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel a shudder of excitement.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.46,0:17:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.92,0:17:59.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'm the one\Nbeing chased now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'm the one\Nbeing chased now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.98,0:18:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason why we\Nwere chosen to become Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason\Nwhy we were chosen
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.18,0:18:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to become Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.40,0:18:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because we're powerful,\Noverwhelmingly so.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.47,0:18:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,Because we're powerful.\NOverwhelmingly so.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.90,0:18:15.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be counting\Non you guys, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Show 'em what we're made of.
